# Large files live in the shared Google Drive folder, not Git (no Git LFS).
# Assets/Project/DriveAssets/ is a mirror of Drive "TroUble/DriveAssets", .meta files included. See ASSETS.md.
/[Aa]ssets/Project/DriveAssets/
/[Aa]ssets/Project/DriveAssets.meta

# Safety net: binaries (and their .meta) are never committed anywhere else in Assets/Project.
# If one of these shows up as ignored, move it into DriveAssets/.
